<title>POLAND: Polish PTR underwrites Amerbank issue.</title>
<headline>Polish PTR underwrites Amerbank issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				    Amerbank SA</p>
<p> Total Issue Size (No of Shares):   1,500,000</p>
<p> Issue Type:				common shares</p>
<p> Price (PLN):			     20</p>
<p> Underwriter:			    SHARES	    STAND-BY FEE</p>
<p>					     UNDERWRITTEN    (PCT)</p>
<p> Polskie Towarzystwo Reasekuracyjne  280,000	    2</p>
<p>NOTE: If the shares need to be taken up the underwriter will receive an additional fee of three percent. On Wednesday Amerbank said MC Concordia underwrote 1,217,418 of the new shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
